  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Autoclave. After cooling to 50C and add aseptically 135 μl of conc. HCl (final conc. 0.05%). Then add aseptically the following solutions."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "For stable culture, incubate the microorganisms in 5 ml of above-mentioned broth in a polystyrene culture flask (25 cmz(2) flask, canted neck, vent cap, AS ONE: Cat. No. 2-8589-01) at 37C under a 5% O2 and 12% CO2 atmosphere (with shaking at low speed; 50 rpm)."
    }
  ]
